	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>Tuae literae, reverende in Christo pater, quarto huius <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>mensis circa prandium mihi sunt redditae; itaque Germanicum <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>exemplar nunc quidem exscribere non potui; remittam <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>post 8 dies, si vixero, et te rogo, interim hanc <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>moram boni consulas<note type="margin">dazu a.R.: "Sed fortassis non petis remitti et hoc exemplari carere potes."</note>.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Scotici regni statum <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>lubentissime audivi.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Utinam <persName ref="p1227">Froscoverus</persName> secum exem<lb xml:id="p1z7"/>plaria Apologiae concilii <placeName ref="l1107">Tridentini</placeName> contra me <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>attulisset; certe liber iam est in manibus adver<lb xml:id="p1z9"/>sariorum, et <persName ref="p8114">Balingketus</persName>, cum esset <placeName ref="l2582">Feldkirchii</placeName>, <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>eum inspexit, sed ex manibus eius, qui habebat, ex<lb xml:id="p1z11"/>torquere eum non potuit.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Exscripsit titulum, qui talis <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>est: <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>Apologia <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>indictionis concilii <placeName ref="l1107">Tridentini</placeName> facta a <persName ref="p20332">Pio <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>IIII.</persName>, pontifice maximo, adversus <persName ref="p8009">Johannem Fabricium <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>Montanum</persName> authore <persName>Casparo Cardillo Villalpal<lb xml:id="p1z17"/>deo</persName>, <placeName ref="l875">Hispano</placeName> Segoviensi, doctore theologiae.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Te <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>ergo, reverende pater, vehementer et reverenter <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>rogo, ut apud <persName ref="p1227">Froscoverum</persName> mihi hanc Apologiam <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>procures.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Sed audio <placeName ref="l834">Italum</placeName> quoque contra me <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>scripsisse.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Utinam nunc habere potuissem hisce <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>feriis authumnalibus; postea enim concionum <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>moles et mercatus negotia me distinebunt.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z24"/><persName>Smittaeum</persName> <placeName ref="l830">Anglum</placeName> superesse nesciebam.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Transiit hac <pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>episcopi <placeName ref="l257">Constantiensis</placeName>, cardinalis <placeName>Emsensis</placeName>, presbyter, <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>homo non indoctus, qui mihi post amicam <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>de religione disceptationem dono dedit <persName>Smittaei</persName> <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>libellum hoc anno <placeName ref="l267">Coloniae</placeName> excusum.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Titulus est de <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>infantium baptismo contra <persName ref="p540">Iohannem Calvinum</persName> ac de operibus <lb xml:id="p2z6"/>super erogation et merito mortis Christi adversus <lb xml:id="p2z7"/>eundem <persName ref="p540">Calvinum</persName> et eius discipulos.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Crebra in eo <lb xml:id="p2z8"/>libello et frequens <persName ref="p495">Bullinger</persName>i, <persName ref="p4091">Zvinglii</persName> <persName ref="p8417">Musculique</persName> ment<lb xml:id="p2z9"/>io.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Existimo te librum iam pridem habuisse.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Quaedam <lb xml:id="p2z10"/>obiter inspexi; videtur scriptor nullius cerebri, plaeraque <lb xml:id="p2z11"/>sunt putida et ex meris mendaciis consuta.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z12"/>Ego hunc presbyterum, quod inter alia sciscitaretur ex <lb xml:id="p2z13"/>me causam, cur subterfugeremus concilium <placeName ref="l1107">Tridentinum</placeName>, <lb xml:id="p2z14"/>oratione mea de concilio remuneratus sum.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">De concilio hic <lb xml:id="p2z15"/>nihil, venit <placeName ref="l425">Roma</placeName>, res <placeName ref="l832">Gallicas</placeName> corrupte et <lb xml:id="p2z16"/>falso narrabat, ut vulgo <placeName ref="l425">Romae</placeName> sparguntur.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z17"/>Quę de <persName>regno Neapolitano</persName> et latronum manu ad d. <lb xml:id="p2z18"/><persName ref="p2054">Martinengum</persName> perscripta sunt, vera esse affirmabat <lb xml:id="p2z19"/>et ultro regem nominabat.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la">Addebat <placeName ref="l1098">Florentinum</placeName> <lb xml:id="p2z20"/>militem cogere, quem mittat nomini <persName>Philippi</persName> <lb xml:id="p2z21"/>contra latrones; scribuntur eadem <placeName ref="l1059">Bellizona</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la">Sed de <lb xml:id="p2z22"/>concilio nihildum habemus; scio <persName ref="p2054">Martinengum</persName>, siquidem <lb xml:id="p2z23"/>valet, officio non defuturum; scribam denuo ad d. <lb xml:id="p2z24"/><persName ref="p2054">Martinengum</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la">De d. d. <persName>Pergula</persName> iam diu nihil habere <lb xml:id="p2z25"/>potui; sed ne <persName ref="p4491">Iulius</persName> quidem eius ditionis minister, <lb xml:id="p2z26"/>iam diu quicquam; satis mirari non possum.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p3z1"/>Quid Venetiis actum sit cum percussoribus comitis <placeName ref="l36">Bergomatis</placeName>, <lb xml:id="p3z2"/>qui ante menses aliquot in templo bombardae ictu est in<lb xml:id="p3z3"/>terfectus, ex scheda apposita intelliges.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la">Pro certo <placeName ref="l522">Venetiis</placeName> <lb xml:id="p3z4"/>ad d. <persName ref="p8114">Balingketum</persName> perscribitur (literas inspexi ipse) <lb xml:id="p3z5"/><placeName ref="l1148">Constantinopolis</placeName> magnam partem terrę motu concidisse, <lb xml:id="p3z6"/><foreign xml:lang="de">die zween drittel söllend yngefallen syn,</foreign> et <placeName ref="l2510">Turcam</placeName> <lb xml:id="p3z7"/>letaliter decumbere (nescio an horrore huius terrę motus).</s>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p3z8"/>Haec sunt, quae nunc habemus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="de">Die pestilentz sol in einer <lb xml:id="p3z9"/>wilde im <placeName ref="l2701">Brättigöuw</placeName>, uff <placeName>Tschuders</placeName> genant, sich yngela<lb xml:id="p3z10"/>ssen haben und zimlich arbeiten; sonst stirbt in Pünten <lb xml:id="p3z11"/>niemand diser kranckheit, so vyl ich weiß; dan <lb xml:id="p3z12"/>zuͦ <placeName ref="l308">Malantz</placeName> und <placeName ref="l2580">Zizers</placeName>, daa es einmal angesetzt, <lb xml:id="p3z13"/>hats wider nachgelassen.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="de">Ich gloub khum, das es uns <lb xml:id="p3z14"/>zuͦ <placeName ref="l98">Cur</placeName> werde überhupffen; aber es ist ein ellend <lb xml:id="p3z15"/>ze hören, was unfründtlichkeit man in disen landen <lb xml:id="p3z16"/>gegen denen erzeigt, denen diser präß zuͦ huß und <lb xml:id="p3z17"/>hoff kompt etc.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p3z18"/>Si quae de concilio habuero, non deero.</s>
					<s n="26" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale, reverende <lb xml:id="p3z19"/>in Christo pater.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="27" xml:lang="la">Deum rogo, ut te ecclesię suae et <lb xml:id="p3z20"/>communi patrię diu incolumem et superstitem conservet.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="28" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p3z21"/><placeName ref="l98">Curię</placeName> 4. octobris anno 1563.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="29" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p3z23"/>Acta <placeName ref="l176">Glaronensia</placeName>, ut ad nostros perscripta sunt, integra <lb xml:id="p3z24"/>legi.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="30" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p3z25"/>Dedit d. <persName ref="p8114">Balingketus</persName> integram historiam, <lb xml:id="p3z26"/>Italice quidem, sed habetis <persName>Iulium</persName> et alios, <lb xml:id="p3z27"/>qui vertere possint; est memo<lb xml:id="p3z28"/>rabilis inprimis.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="31" xml:lang="la">Non est, quod remitta<lb xml:id="p3z29"/>s.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="32" xml:lang="la">Tui o<lb xml:id="p3z30"/>bservantissimus <persName ref="p8009">Iohannes <lb xml:id="p3z31"/>Fabricius</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="33" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p4z1"/>Amplissimo viro d. <persName ref="p495">Heinrycho <lb xml:id="p4z2"/>Bullingero</persName>, ecclesię <placeName ref="l587">Tigurinae</placeName> <lb xml:id="p4z3"/>antistiti reverendo, domino <lb xml:id="p4z4"/>suo et in Christo patri ho<lb xml:id="p4z5"/>norando.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="34" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p4z6"/><placeName ref="l587">Tiguri</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
